            <li><strong class="text-white">Technical and Organisational Measures (TOMs):</strong> Encryption in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256); per-tenant data isolation via PostgreSQL Row-Level Security (RLS) bound to unique Sovereign Keys; Role-based access control (RBAC) on a least-privilege basis; HMAC-SHA256 signature verification for all Meta and Shopify webhook payloads.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">Sub-processors:</strong> General written authorisation granted by the Merchant; 14 days' prior notice of any new sub-processor; Merchant may object on reasonable data protection grounds.</li>
