            <li><strong class="text-white">Breach notification:</strong> Notify the Merchant <strong class="text-white">within 48 hours</strong> of confirming a personal data breach, with details of the nature, affected data categories, estimated number of data subjects, likely consequences, and remediation measures.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">DPIAs:</strong> Provide reasonable assistance with Data Protection Impact Assessments at the Merchant's reasonable cost.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">Deletion on termination:</strong> Delete or return all Customer Personal Data within 30 days of termination and provide written confirmation.</li>
