            <li>A documented <strong class="text-white">Transfer Impact Assessment (TIA)</strong> conducted in accordance with <em>Schrems II</em> (Case C-311/18) and EDPB Recommendations 01/2020, including end-to-end encryption in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256), with cryptographic keys managed within the EU or by an independent EU custodian.</li>
